Tue Nov 24 18:30:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- vilna-llm.service and system.slice: MemoryLow=65% of the RAM instead of a
  fixed 5G. On 6 GB the fixed 5G left the rest of the system ~1 GB and the
  Live installer stalled (PSI full 47 %, 4.5 % with 65 %); on 8 GB 65 % is
  ~5 GB and as good as before (VM, 24.11.2026).

