Tue Nov 24 20:00:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- vilna-llm.service runs the local model on the graphics chip through
  Vulkan (--n-gpu-layers 99, Requires: libggml-vulkan, group render, Mesa
  shader cache in /var/cache/vilna-llm). Iris Xe, Qwen3 4B: prompt 44 ->
  141 tok/s, writing ~8.4 tok/s as before, ~1.15 GB more memory.

